   "date": "2018-03-22",
   "text": "Ammunition Background Check Act of 2018\n This bill establishes new federal requirements for ammunition sales. \n Among other things, the bill does the following:\n establishes background check requirements,\n expands recordkeeping requirements, and\n establishes reporting requirements for certain bulk sales."
